{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月14日。ブログ一周年です！\nぱちぱちぱち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを書いてもう一年\nたったんだよー！びっくり。\n最初らへんの記事、読んだけど\nだいぶ恥ずかしかった...\nぞわわわわーってなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たった一年で自分変わったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント数も気づいたら\nだんだん増えてて。\n最初はちょっとでも嬉しかったのに...\nというか、「すげー！」って\n気持ちだった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、読んでくれてるかな？とか\nコメントしてくれるのかな？とか\nいろいろ考えるようになりました。\n私なんかのために、\n本当にありがとう><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで更新続けられるのは\nみなさんのおかげです。‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼質問回答タイムだよ！／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンモスフリーマーケット\nには来るの??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみすぎるー♪るん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬のルームウェアはどんなん?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度握手会で着ようかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山登りしたことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよー修学旅行とかで笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪長いなー邪魔にならないん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ときどき邪魔になるよー\nでも髪型でかわいくできるなら\n余裕で我慢できるっ\n女の子だもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆乳、青汁が苦手なんですが\nスムージーなら飲めますかね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も両方とも苦手だったけど\n混ぜたら味が消えて飲みやすく\nなったし、豆乳はすきになったよ！\nなにより健康的だから、\n朝に飲むといいかもー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮭の切り身は捌ける様に\nなったかな～⁈"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あ。忘れてた\nママに教えてもらう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり料理はできる方が\nいいですよね？(男女ともに)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......そうだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理できるように頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮭はどのように料理して\n食べるのが好きなのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプルに焼いて、\n塩とレモンかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかやってみたい\n髪型とかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、日常じゃできないやつ。\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ここでなかいさんをはさむよ！／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ一周年ということで、\nリニューアルしたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の書き出しを無くして、\nもっと自由にしようと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...まぁそれだけなんだけどもね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな意見聞いた結果です。\nゆるく始まる方が私らしいです！\nたぶん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、書かなくなったからといって\n気持ちは変わりません。\n初心を忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回目で載せたのとまた違う加工の。\nどっち載せるか迷ってた。\n自撮り下手くっそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもまりかブログを\nよろしくお願いしますします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}